      '[{"display_name":"Default Quotes","name":"default_quotes","description":"Motivational and inspirational quotes included in Moo.","type":"quotes","version":"1.0.0","author":"The Moo Authors","quotes":[{"quote":"If you look at what you have in life, you\'ll always have more.","author":"Oprah Winfrey","occupation":"American talk show host"},{"quote":"The key responsibility of leadership is to think about the future.","author":"Brian Tracy","occupation":"Canadian motivational speaker"},{"quote":"The bad news is time flies. The good news, is you\'re the pilot.","author":"Michael Altshuler","occupation":null},{"quote":"Hard times don\'t create heroes. It is during the hard times when the \'hero\' within us is revealed.","author":"Bob Riley","occupation":"Former Governor of Alabama"},{"quote":"Step by step the thing is done.","author":"Charles Atlas","occupation":"Italian-American bodybuilder"},{"quote":"Nothing is impossible, the word itself says \'I\'m possible\'!","author":"Audrey Hepburn","occupation":"British actress"},{"quote":"If opportunity doesn\'t knock, build a door.","author":"Kurt Cobain","occupation":"American singer-songwriter"},{"quote":"The hard days are what make you stronger.","author":"Aly Raisman","occupation":"American gymnast"},{"quote":"Focus on being productive instead of busy.","author":"Tim Ferriss","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"Be kind whenever possible. It is always possible","author":"Dalai Lama","occupation":null},{"quote":"Don\'t let yesterday take up too much of today.","author":"Will Rogers","occupation":"American actor"},{"quote":"Success is walking from failure to failure with no loss of enthusiasm.","author":"Winston Churchill","occupation":"Former Prime Minister of the United Kingdom"},{"quote":"Don\'t wish it were easier. Wish you were better.","author":"Jim Rohn","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"However difficult life may seem, there is always something you can do and succeed at.","author":"Stephen Hawking","occupation":"English theoretical physicist"},{"quote":"Success doesn\'t come to you; you go to it.","author":"T. Scott McLeod","occupation":"Rugby union player"},{"quote":"If it scares you, it might be a good thing to try.","author":"Seth Godin","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"What\'s on the other side of fear? Nothing.","author":"Jamie Foxx","occupation":"American actor"},{"quote":"Whatever the mind can conceive and believe, it can achieve.","author":"Napoleon Hill","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"With the right kind of coaching and determination you can accomplish anything.","author":"Reese Witherspoon","occupation":"American actress"},{"quote":"Those who can\'t change their minds, can\'t change anything.","author":"George Shaw","occupation":"English artist"},{"quote":"Set your goals high, and don\'t stop till you get there.","author":"Bo Jackson","occupation":"American former American football player"},{"quote":"Life\'s like a movie, write your own ending. Keep believing, keep pretending.","author":"Jim Hensen","occupation":"American puppeteer"},{"quote":"Be the change that you wish to see in the world.","author":"Mahatma Gandhi","occupation":"Indian lawyer"},{"quote":"Only do what your heart tells you.","author":"Princess Diana","occupation":"Princess of Wales"},{"quote":"Opportunities don\'t happen. You create them.","author":"Chris Grosser","occupation":"Entrepreneur"},{"quote":"The best project you\'ll ever work on is you.","author":"Sonny Franco","occupation":null},{"quote":"It seems impossible until it\'s done.","author":"Nelson Mandela","occupation":"Former President of South Africa"},{"quote":"A champion is defined not by their wins but by how they can recover when they fall.","author":"Serena Williams","occupation":"American tennis player"},{"quote":"If you can tune into your purpose and really align with it, setting goals so that your vision is an expression of that purpose, then life flows much more easily.","author":"Jack Canfield","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"The true success is the person who invented himself.","author":"Al Goldstein","occupation":"American critic"},{"quote":"If you are working on something that you really care about, you don\'t have to be pushed. The vision pulls you.","author":"Steve Jobs","occupation":"American business magnate"},{"quote":"Don\'t limit your challenges. Challenge your limits.","author":"Martonek Jr","occupation":"Author"},{"quote":"You can find a better you inside of you. Why don\'t you search for that?","author":"Munia Khan","occupation":"Author"},{"quote":"Start where you are. Use what you have. Do what you can.","author":"Arthur Ashe","occupation":"American tennis player"},{"quote":"Well done is better than well said.","author":"Benjamin Franklin","occupation":"Founding Father of the United States"},{"quote":"Time goes on. So whatever you\'re going to do, do it. Do it now. Don\'t wait.","author":"Robert De Niro","occupation":"American actor"},{"quote":"Always keep your eyes open. Keep watching. Because whatever you see can inspire you.","author":"Grace Coddington","occupation":"Welsh former model"},{"quote":"If you don\'t ask, you don\'t get.","author":"Stevie Wonder","occupation":"American singer-songwriter"},{"quote":"No bird soars too high if he soars with his own wings.","author":"William Blake","occupation":"English poet"},{"quote":"It does not matter how slowly you go as long as you do not stop.","author":"Confucius","occupation":"Chinese philosopher"},{"quote":"If you can dream it, you can achieve it.","author":"Zig Ziglar","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"Everything you\'ve ever wanted is on the other side of fear","author":"George Addair","occupation":"real-estate developer"},{"quote":"If you don\'t like how things are, change it!","author":"Jim Rohn","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"The control center of your life is your attitude.","author":"Norman Cousins","occupation":"American political journalist"},{"quote":"It takes courage to grow up and become who you really are.","author":"E.E Cummings","occupation":"American poet"},{"quote":"Your true success in life begins only when you make the commitment to become excellent at what you do.","author":"Brian Tracy","occupation":"Canadian motivational speaker"},{"quote":"Always do what you are afraid to do.","author":"Ralph Waldo Emerson","occupation":"American essayist"},{"quote":"I would rather die of passion than of boredom.","author":"Vincent van Gogh","occupation":"Dutch painter"},{"quote":"A will finds a way.","author":"Orison Marden","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"I\'m taking all the negatives in my life, and turning them into a positive.","author":"Pitbull","occupation":"American rapper"},{"quote":"All we can do is the best we can do.","author":"David Axelrod","occupation":"Former Senior Advisor to the President of the United States"},{"quote":"If you can dream it, you can do it.","author":"Walt Disney","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"Problems are not stop signs, they are guidelines.","author":"Robert H. Schuller","occupation":"American Televangelist"},{"quote":"Either I will find a way, or I will make one.","author":"Phillip Sidney","occupation":"English Poet"},{"quote":"There\'s a way to do it better - find it.","author":"Thomas Edison","occupation":"American Inventor"},{"quote":"Do the best you can. No one can do more than that.","author":"John Wooden","occupation":"American Basketball Coach"},{"quote":"Motivation comes from working on things we care about.","author":"Sheryl Sandberg","occupation":"COO of Facebook"},{"quote":"Believe in yourself, take on your challenges, dig deep within yourself to conquer fears. Never let anyone bring you down. You got to keep going","author":"Chantal Sutherland","occupation":"Canadian Model"},{"quote":"Keep your face to the sunshine and you cannot see a shadow.","author":"Helen Keller","occupation":"American Author"},{"quote":"Dream big and dare to fail.","author":"Norman Vaughan","occupation":"Comedian"},{"quote":"Hope never abandons you, you abandon it.","author":"George Weinberg","occupation":null},{"quote":"Life is like riding a bicycle. To keep your balance, you must keep moving.","author":"Albert Einstein","occupation":"Theoretical physicist"},{"quote":"Don\'t watch the clock; do what it does. Keep going.","author":"Sam Levenson","occupation":"American Actor"},{"quote":"If the plan doesn\'t work, change the plan, but never the goal.","author":null,"occupation":null},{"quote":"If something is important enough, even if the odds are stacked against you, you should still do it.","author":"Elon Musk","occupation":"CEO of Tesla"},{"quote":"Give up on being perfect and start working on becoming yourself.","author":"Anna Quindlen","occupation":"American Author"},{"quote":"Be a voice not an echo.","author":"Albert Einstein","occupation":"Theoretical physicist"},{"quote":"Dreaming, after all, is a form of planning.","author":"Gloria Steinem","occupation":"American Journalist"},{"quote":"Life is 10% what happens to you and 90% how you react to it.","author":"Charles R. Swindoll","occupation":null},{"quote":"In the middle of every difficulty lies opportunity.","author":"Albert Einstein","occupation":"Theoretical physicist"},{"quote":"I never lose. Either I win or learn.","author":"Nelson Mandela","occupation":"Former President of South Africa"},{"quote":"It always seems impossible until it\'s done.","author":"Nelson Mandela","occupation":"Former President of South Africa"},{"quote":"You gotta water your plants. Nobody can water them for you.","author":"DJ Khaled","occupation":"American DJ"},{"quote":"Work hard, be kind and amazing things will happen.","author":"Conan O\'Brien","occupation":"American television host"},{"quote":"A winner is a dreamer who never gives up.","author":"Nelson Mandela","occupation":"Former President of South Africa"},{"quote":"Make the most of yourself...for that is all there is of you","author":"Ralph Waldo Emerson","occupation":"American essayist"},{"quote":"Believe you can and you\'re halfway there.","author":"Theodore Roosevelt","occupation":"26th U.S. President"},{"quote":"Eighty percent of success is showing up.","author":"Woody Allen","occupation":"American film director"},{"quote":"Some people look for a beautiful place. Others make a place beautiful.","author":"Hazrat Inayat Khan","occupation":"Professor"},{"quote":"Either you run the day, or the day runs you.","author":"Jim Rohn","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"Sometimes later becomes never. Do it now.","author":null,"occupation":null},{"quote":"Never regret anything that made you smile.","author":"Mark Twain","occupation":"American writer"},{"quote":"Go the extra mile. It\'s never crowded there.","author":"Wayne Dyer","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"Whatever you are, be a good one.","author":"Abraham Lincoln","occupation":"16th U.S. President"},{"quote":"If you can dream it, you can do it.","author":"Walt Disney","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"A goal is a dream with a deadline.","author":"Napoleon Hill","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"There are no traffic jams along the extra mile.","author":"Roger Staubach","occupation":"American football player"},{"quote":"Too many of us are not living our dreams because we are living our fears.","author":"Les Brown","occupation":"Former Ohio State Representative"},{"quote":"Life is what happens to you while you\'re busy making other plans.","author":"John Lennon","occupation":"Singer-songwriter"},{"quote":"Believe in yourself. You are braver than you think, more talented than you know, and capable of more than you imagine.","author":"Roy T. Bennett","occupation":"Author"},{"quote":"In a gentle way, you can shake the world.","author":"Mahatma Gandhi","occupation":"Indian lawyer"},{"quote":"There is only one thing that makes a dream impossible to achieve: the fear of failure.","author":"Paulo Coelho","occupation":"Brazilian lyricist"},{"quote":"Learn to enjoy every minute of your life.","author":"Earl Nightingale","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"If you don\'t have a competitive advantage, don\'t compete.","author":"Jack Welch","occupation":"American executive"},{"quote":"Work until your rivals become idols.","author":"Drake","occupation":"Canadian rapper"},{"quote":"It is never too late to be what you might have been.","author":"George Eliot","occupation":"English novelist"},{"quote":"Accomplishing the impossible is all about seeing the invisible.","author":"Steven Furtick","occupation":"American pastor"},{"quote":"The two most important days in your life are the day you are born and the day you find out why.","author":"Mark Twain","occupation":"American writer"},{"quote":"In order to succeed, we must first believe that we can.","author":"Nikos Kazantzakis","occupation":"Greek writer"},{"quote":"Impossible is just an opinion.","author":"Paulo Coelho","occupation":"Brazilian lyricist"},{"quote":"The man who does not read has no advantage over the man who cannot read.","author":"Mark Twain","occupation":"American writer"},{"quote":"A pessimist sees the difficulty in every opportunity; an optimist sees the opportunity in every difficulty.","author":"Winston Churchill","occupation":"Former Prime Minister of the United Kingdom"},{"quote":"It\'s not whether you get knocked down, it\'s whether you get up.","author":"Vince Lombardi","occupation":"American football coach"},{"quote":"Make each day your masterpiece.","author":"John Wooden","occupation":"American basketball coach"},{"quote":"You are the only one who can limit your greatness","author":null,"occupation":null},{"quote":"If you believe it will work out, you\'ll see opportunities. If you believe it won\'t, you will see obstacles.","author":"Wayne Dyer","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"Success is not final, failure is not fatal: it is the courage to continue that counts.","author":"Winston Churchill","occupation":"Former Prime Minister of the United Kingdom"},{"quote":"All our dreams can come true, if we have the courage to pursue them.","author":"Walt Disney","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"The way to get started is to quit talking and begin doing.","author":"Walt Disney","occupation":"American entrepreneur"}],"created_at":"2025-10-03T23:29:20.000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T13:31:21.000Z","id":"0c8a5bdebd13","canonical_path":"quote_packs/default_quotes","in_collections":[]}]',
