a bicycle. To keep your balance, you must keep moving.","author":"Albert Einstein","occupation":"Theoretical physicist"},{"quote":"Don\'t watch the clock; do what it does. Keep going.","author":"Sam Levenson","occupation":"American Actor"},{"quote":"If the plan doesn\'t work, change the plan, but never the goal.","author":null,"occupation":null},{"quote":"If something is important enough, even if the odds are stacked against you, you should still do it.","author":"Elon Musk","occupation":"CEO of Tesla"},{"quote":"Give up on being perfect and start working on becoming yourself.","author":"Anna Quindlen","occupation":"American Author"},{"quote":"Be a voice not an echo.","author":"Albert Einstein","occupation":"Theoretical physicist"},{"quote":"Dreaming, after all, is a form of planning.","author":"Gloria Steinem","occupation":"American Journalist"},{"quote":"Life is 10% what happens to you and 90% how you react to it.","author":"Charles R. Swindoll","occupation":null},{"quote":"In the middle of every difficulty lies opportunity.","author":"Albert Einstein","occupation":"Theoretical physicist"},{"quote":"I never lose. Either I win or learn.","author":"Nelson Mandela","occupation":"Former President of South Africa"},{"quote":"It always seems impossible until it\'s done.","author":"Nelson Mandela","occupation":"Former President of South Africa"},{"quote":"You gotta water your plants. Nobody can water them for you.","author":"DJ Khaled","occupation":"American DJ"},{"quote":"Work hard, be kind and amazing things will happen.","author":"Conan O\'Brien","occupation":"American television host"},{"quote":"A winner is a dreamer who never gives up.","author":"Nelson Mandela","occupation":"Former President of South Africa"},{"quote":"Make the most of yourself...for that is all there is of you","author":"Ralph Waldo Emerson","occupation":"American essayist"},{"quote":"Believe you can and you\'re halfway there.","author":"Theodore Roosevelt","occupation":"26th U.S. President"},{"quote":"Eighty percent of success is showing up.","author":"Woody Allen","occupation":"American film director"},{"quote":"Some people look for a beautiful place. Others make a place beautiful.","author":"Hazrat Inayat Khan","occupation":"Professor"},{"quote":"Either you run the day, or the day runs you.","author":"Jim Rohn","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"Sometimes later becomes never. Do it now.","author":null,"occupation":null},{"quote":"Never regret anything that made you smile.","author":"Mark Twain","occupation":"American writer"},{"quote":"Go the extra mile. It\'s never crowded there.","author":"Wayne Dyer","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"Whatever you are, be a good one.","author":"Abraham Lincoln","occupation":"16th U.S. President"},{"quote":"If you can dream it, you can do it.","author":"Walt Disney","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"A goal is a dream with a deadline.","author":"Napoleon Hill","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"There are no traffic jams along the extra mile.","author":"Roger Staubach","occupation":"American football player"},{"quote":"Too many of us are not living our dreams because we are living our fears.","author":"Les Brown","occupation":"Former Ohio State Representative"},{"quote":"Life is what happens to you while you\'re busy making other plans.","author":"John Lennon","occupation":"Singer-songwriter"},{"quote":"Believe in yourself. You are braver than you think, more talented than you know, and capable of more than you imagine.","author":"Roy T. Bennett","occupation":"Author"},{"quote":"In a gentle way, you can shake the world.","author":"Mahatma Gandhi","occupation":"Indian lawyer"},{"quote":"There is only one thing that makes a dream impossible to achieve: the fear of failure.","author":"Paulo Coelho","occupation":"Brazilian lyricist"},{"quote":"Learn to enjoy every minute of your life.","author":"Earl Nightingale","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"If you don\'t have a competitive advantage, don\'t compete.","author":"Jack Welch","occupation":"American executive"},{"quote":"Work until your rivals become idols.","author":"Drake","occupation":"Canadian rapper"},{"quote":"It is never too late to be what you might have been.","author":"George Eliot","occupation":"English novelist"},{"quote":"Accomplishing the impossible is all about seeing the invisible.","author":"Steven Furtick","occupation":"American pastor"},{"quote":"The two most important days in your life are the day you are born and the day you find out why.","author":"Mark Twain","occupation":"American writer"},{"quote":"In order to succeed, we must first believe that we can.","author":"Nikos Kazantzakis","occupation":"Greek writer"},{"quote":"Impossible is just an opinion.","author":"Paulo Coelho","occupation":"Brazilian lyricist"},{"quote":"The man who does not read has no advantage over the man who cannot read.","author":"Mark Twain","occupation":"American writer"},{"quote":"A pessimist sees the difficulty in every opportunity; an optimist sees the opportunity in every difficulty.","author":"Winston Churchill","occupation":"Former Prime Minister of the United Kingdom"},{"quote":"It\'s not whether you get knocked down, it\'s whether you get up.","author":"Vince Lombardi","occupation":"American football coach"},{"quote":"Make each day your masterpiece.","author":"John Wooden","occupation":"American basketball coach"},{"quote":"You are the only one who can limit your greatness","author":null,"occupation":null},{"quote":"If you believe it will work out, you\'ll see opportunities. If you believe it won\'t, you will see obstacles.","author":"Wayne Dyer","occupation":"American author"},{"quote":"Success is not final, failure is not fatal: it is the courage to continue that counts.","author":"Winston Churchill","occupation":"Former Prime Minister of the United Kingdom"},{"quote":"All our dreams can come true, if we have the courage to pursue them.","author":"Walt Disney","occupation":"American entrepreneur"},{"quote":"The way to get started is to quit talking and begin doing.","author":"Walt Disney","occupation":"American entrepreneur"}]',
    refresh: 'false',
    searchEngine: 'duckduckgo',
    shortFormat: 'dots',
    showReminder: 'false',
    showWelcome: 'false',
    showlocation: 'true',
    stats: 'true',
    statsData: '{}',
    tabName: 'New Tab',
    tempformat: 'celsius',
    textBorder: 'new',
    theme: 'dark',
    time: 'true',
    timeType: 'digital',
    timeformat: 'twentyfourhour',
    toastDisplayTime: '2500',
    view: 'false',
    weatherEnabled: 'true',
    quickWeatherEnabled: 'false',
    weatherType: '2',
    widgetStyle: 'new',
    windspeed: 'true',
    zero: 'true',
    cinemaMode: 'true',
    rssEnabled: 'false',
    backgroundchange: 'refresh',
    clock: '24',
    seconds: 'false',
    aiAskEnabled: 'true',
    googleMailEnabled: 'true',
    googleCalendarEnabled: 'true',
    googleTasksEnabled: 'true',
    googleMailSnippet: 'true',
    googleMailMax: '3',
    googleMailPrimary: 'sender',
    googleCalendarMax: '3',
    googleCalendar24Hour: 'true',
    googleTasksMax: '3',
    googleTasksList: 'demo-list',
    rssCenteredDefaultOff: 'true',
    scratchNotes: 'false',
    scratchImages: 'false',
    signatureColour: '#6ba8a0',
    widgetPlacement: '{"weather": "right", "photoinfo": "left", "rss": "center"}',
    widgetSecondLane: '["calendar", "tasks"]',
    surfaceMail: '',
    surfaceCalendar: '',
    surfaceTasks: '',
    todoEnabled: 'false',
    refreshEnabled: 'false',
    viewEnabled: 'false',
  };
  await page.addInitScript(
    ({ seed }) => {
      if (!location.href.startsWith('http://127.0.0.1:5173')) return;
      const now = new Date('2026-10-26T09:41:00Z').getTime();
      const RealDate = Date;
      window.Date = class extends RealDate {
        constructor(...args) {
          super(...(args.length ? args : [now]));
        }
        static now() {
          return now;
        }
      };
      localStorage.clear();
      for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(seed)) localStorage.setItem(key, value);
      localStorage.setItem(
        'customBackground',
        JSON.stringify([location.origin + '/output/playwright/media/forest.mp4']),
      );
      const auth = {
        accessToken: 'fictional-capture-token',
        refreshToken: null,
        expiresAt: now + 3600000,
        email: 'demo@example.invalid',
        name: 'Demo',
        connectedAt: 1,
      };
      window.browser = {
        storage: {
          local: {
            get: async () => ({ googleAuth: auth }),
            set: async () => {},
            remove: async () => {},
          },
          onChanged: { addListener() {}, removeListener() {} },
        },
      };
    },
    { seed },
  );
  const messages = [
    {
      id: 'demo1',
      from: 'Lena Brooks',
      subject: 'A quiet weekend by the coast',
      snippet: 'Found a little cabin with a view of the water. Saturday looks clear.',
      date: 'Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:18:00 +0000',
    },
    {
      id: 'demo2',
      from: 'Northfield Studio',
      subject: 'The first sketches are ready',
      snippet: 'The latest drawings are in the shared folder whenever you have a moment.',
      date: 'Mon, 26 Oct 2026 08:52:00 +0000',
    },
    {
      id: 'demo3',
      from: 'Sam Rivera',
      subject: 'Coffee after the walk?',
      snippet: 'I can meet you at the corner café around three.',
      date: 'Mon, 26 Oct 2026 08:30:00 +0000',
    },
  ];
  await page.route('**/*', async (route) => {
    const url = new URL(route.request().url());
    if (url.hostname === '127.0.0.1' || url.hostname === 'localhost') return route.continue();
    let data;
    if (url.hostname === 'www.googleapis.com') {
      if (url.pathname.endsWith('/calendarList'))
        data = {
          items: [
            {
              id: 'primary',
              summary: 'Personal',
              primary: true,
              accessRole: 'owner',
              backgroundColor: '#6ba8a0',
            },
          ],
        };
      else if (url.pathname.includes('/calendar/'))
        data = {
          items: [
            {
              id: 'event1',
              summary: 'Morning planning',
              start: { dateTime: '2026-10-26T10:00:00Z' },
              end: { dateTime: '2026-10-26T10:30:00Z' },
              location: 'Home office',
            },
            {
              id: 'event2',
              summary: 'A walk by the river',
              start: { dateTime: '2026-10-26T12:30:00Z' },
              end: { dateTime: '2026-10-26T13:15:00Z' },
              location: 'Riverside path',
            },
            {
              id: 'event3',
              summary: 'Design catch-up',
              start: { dateTime: '2026-10-26T15:00:00Z' },
              end: { dateTime: '2026-10-26T15:30:00Z' },
              location: 'Northfield Studio',
            },
          ],
        };
      else if (url.pathname.endsWith('/users/@me/lists'))
        data = { items: [{ id: 'demo-list', title: 'Today' }] };
      else if (url.pathname.includes('/tasks/'))
        data = {
          items: [
            {
              id: 'task1',
              title: 'Finish the reading list',
              status: 'needsAction',
              due: '2026-10-26T00:00:00Z',
            },
            {
              id: 'task2',
              title: 'Pick up coffee beans',
              status: 'needsAction',
              due: '2026-10-26T00:00:00Z',
            },
            {
              id: 'task3',
              title: 'Plan a weekend outside',
              status: 'needsAction',
              due: '2026-10-27T00:00:00Z',
            },
          ],
        };
      else if (url.pathname.match(/\/messages\/[^/]+$/)) {
        const item = messages.find((item) => url.pathname.endsWith('/' + item.id));
        data = {
          id: item.id,
          threadId: item.id,
          labelIds: ['UNREAD'],
          snippet: item.snippet,
          payload: {
            headers: ['From', 'Subject', 'Date'].map((name) => ({
              name,
              value: item[name.toLowerCase()],
            })),
          },
        };
      } else
        data = {
          messages: messages.map(({ id }) => ({ id, threadId: id })),
          resultSizeEstimate: 3,
        };
    } else if (url.hostname === 'api.muetab.com' && url.pathname.includes('/weather')) {
      data = {
        main: {
          temp: 286.15,
          temp_min: 283.15,
          temp_max: 288.15,
          feels_like: 285.15,
          humidity: 77,
          pressure: 1016,
        },
        weather: [{ icon: '04d', description: 'Cloudy' }],
        wind: { speed: 2.1, deg: 220 },
        clouds: { all: 80 },
        visibility: 10000,
      };
    } else return route.abort();
    await route.fulfill({
      status: 200,
      contentType: 'application/json',
      body: JSON.stringify(data),
    });
  });
  await page.goto('http://127.0.0.1:5173/');
  await page.getByText('A quiet weekend by the coast', { exact: true }).waitFor();
  await page.getByText('Morning planning', { exact: true }).waitFor();
  await page.getByText('Pick up coffee beans', { exact: true }).waitFor();
  await page.waitForFunction(() => {
    const video = document.querySelector('video');
    return video && video.readyState >= 2 && !video.paused;
  });
  await page.locator('input.aiAskInput').evaluate((element) => element.blur());
  await page.waitForTimeout(1800);
  await page.screenshot({ path: 'output/playwright/demo-forest.png' });
  return { viewport: page.viewportSize(), title: await page.title(), sampleData: true };
}
